📊 Santiment: the lower the 30-day MVRV (average coin circulation time), the lower the risk of opening or increasing a position in short-term trading.
Negative values mean that average traders are losing money and there is an opportunity for the token to catch up. Positive values mean that average traders are making profits, and there is a risk of the token holding on because of the profits of other participants.
